## What points at what
#
# **A reference is always to a relation's `id`.** The engine checks that such a row is there, so a
# value pointing at nothing is refused when the data is read rather than when it is used.

{reference id:1 column:4 to:relation}
{reference id:2 column:8 to:column}
{reference id:3 column:9 to:relation}
{reference id:4 column:11 to:relation}
